    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2em;margin-bottom:12px;\">DESIGNING A PUBLIC BUILDING:<br>THE TAYLOR CONCERT HALL</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;\">Introduction</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">The designer of a public building may need to consider the building&rsquo;s</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; function</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; physical and <strong>31</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> context</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; symbolic meaning</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:12px;\">Location and concept of the Concert Hall</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">On the site of a disused <strong>32</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">Beside a <strong>33</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">The design is based on the concept of a mystery</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:12px;\">Building design</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">It&rsquo;s approached by a <strong>34</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> for pedestrians</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">The building is the shape of a <strong>35</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">One exterior wall acts as a large <strong>36</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">In the auditorium:</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&bull;&nbsp; the floor is built on huge pads made of <strong>37</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&bull;&nbsp; the walls are made of local wood and are <strong>38</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> in shape</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&bull;&nbsp; ceiling panels and <strong>39</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> on walls allow adjustment of acoustics</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:12px;\">Evaluation</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">Some critics say the <strong>40</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:150px;text-align:center;\"> style of the building is inappropriate</p></div></div>",
